@startuml
title Target Notaire Architecture (Modern Web Frontend)
left to right direction

actor User as "Usuario final"

node "Cliente Web (Next.js 15)" {
  [React UI (Design Tokens)] as WebUI
  [API Client / TanStack Query] as WebClient
  [Next.js BFF / Route Handlers] as BFF
}

node "Cliente Legacy (Swing)" #LightGray {
  [Swing UI] as SwingUI
  [REST Client] as SwingClient
}

node "Backend API (Spring Boot 4)" {
  [REST Controllers] as API
  [Business Services] as Service
  [Repositories] as Repo
  [Domain Entities] as Domain
}

database "PostgreSQL 16" as Postgres
cloud "Shared Contracts (DTOs)" as Shared

node "Observability (LPG Stack)" {
  [Prometheus]
  [Grafana]
  [Loki]
}

User --> WebUI : UI requests
WebUI --> WebClient : React hooks
WebClient --> BFF : API calls
BFF --> API : HTTP/JSON (JWT)

User ..> SwingUI : Legacy access
SwingUI --> SwingClient : API calls
SwingClient --> API : HTTP/JSON (JWT)

API --> Service : Request processing
Service --> Repo : Persistence operations
Repo --> Postgres : SQL / JPA
API --> Shared : DTO contracts

API --( LPG : Metrics/Logs
@enduml
